description	"91st Clone Trooper

Clone troopers characterized by scouting equipment and grounded speed.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee

^6Inventory:
- Binoculars 

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (2)
- Stamina (1)
- 10% less knockback taken
- Tracking Beacon

^3Abilities:
- Dodge ^3[CS1]
- Sprint (1) ^3[CS2]"